.TH WM-CAMERA 1
.SH NAME
camera \- show the camera, live
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B wm/camera
.SH DESCRIPTION
.I Camera
shows the feed at
.B /mnt/video/0
in a window, mounting
.IR camsrv (4)
there if nothing is. Holding the feed open keeps the camera on; when
the window goes and nothing else is reading, it goes off.
.PP
The keys
.B +
and
.B -
move the lens's focus,
.B a
runs autofocus once, and
.B q
exits.
.SH SOURCE
.B /appl/wm/camera.b
.SH SEE ALSO
.IR camsrv (4)
.SH BUGS
Resizing the window does not scale the picture, which stays in the
middle of it. A hidden window keeps the camera on.
